      "message": "Would it make sense to move these fields into `struct DecodingState` defined above?  Everything else that gets initialized in `startDecoding` is put into the `DecodingState`.  This is probably not terribly important, but it seems nice to be consistent here.  And this also means that after decoding a full frame the decoding state is [reset](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/experimental/rust_png/decoder/impl/SkPngRustCodec.cpp;l\u003d1000;drc\u003d2cad1f845f3c0a3f205b6b2d870b99fd657c710b) so we should never encounter stale data",
